      "line": 15,
      "raw_start_codepoint": 5,
      "raw_end_codepoint": 34,
      "quote": "郭璞複上疏，請因皇孫生，下赦令，帝從之。乙卯，大赦，改元。",
      "reading": "永昌元年正月乙卯大赦改元。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/jin072-roll/external/tj093-ws2311925.wikitext",
      "revision": 2311925,
      "line": 35,
      "raw_start_codepoint": 112,
      "raw_end_codepoint": 131,
      "quote": "曰：「命盡今日日中。」敦乃收璞，斬之。",
      "reading": "繫太寧二年，接六月兵事敘事，日未具。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/jin072-roll/external/jin008-ws2644502.wikitext",
      "revision": 2644502,
      "line": 30,
      "raw_start_codepoint": 2,
      "raw_end_codepoint": 43,
      "quote": "秋七月庚午，持節、都尉江荊司梁雍益寧七州諸軍事、江州刺史、征西將軍、都亭侯庾翼卒。",
      "reading": "穆帝紀永和元年。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/jin072-roll/external/shishuo-qiyi-ws2361658.wikitext",
      "revision": 2361658,
      "line": 13,
      "raw_start_codepoint": 57,
      "raw_end_codepoint": 78,
      "quote": "何準字幼道，廬江灊人。驃騎將軍充第五弟也。",
      "reading": "世說注引晉中興書。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/jin072-roll/external/jin094-ws5854886.wikitext",
      "revision": 5854886,
      "line": 83,
      "raw_start_codepoint": 2,
      "raw_end_codepoint": 15,
      "quote": "郭文，字文舉，河內軹人也。",
      "reading": "卷九十四本傳籍里及字。"
    },
    {
      "path": "source-evidence/jin072-roll/external/j081-ws11237683.wikitext",
